# Pinned floating windows: kept on their rule's workspace so AeroSpace
# never stashes them apart from it. One rule per line, '#' comments.
#
#   <matcher>                keeps the FOCUSED workspace
#   <matcher> >> <anchor>    keeps the workspace of the first window
#                            matching <anchor>
#
# Matchers are case-insensitive substrings of "<AppName> <WindowTitle>".
# A game overlay must live with the game, not with the workspace the app
# was started from:
Firestone Overlay >> Hearthstone
